*.db                    binary
*.sqlite                binary
*.sqlite3               binary
*.pyc                   binary
*.pyo                   binary
*.pyd                   binary
*.so                    binary
*.dll                   binary
*.dylib                 binary
*.exe                   binary
*.bin                   binary
